description:
## Goal

Prove the completed epic satisfies the exact-reuse contract and remove every construction artifact left by the cutovers.

## Production proof

Using one retained Compiler2, exercise cold, identical, unrelated edit, identical explicit replacement, location-only replacement, relevant leaf edit, recursive support removal, failed unchanged retry, unrelated request after failure, and successful re-evaluation after a relevant correction.

Authoritative assertions:

- identical request: zero formula/product/native-body evaluation, lowering, codegen, relink, and deep artifact copy;
- unrelated edit: zero work attributable to the requested root;
- relevant edit: every evaluation is in the exact transitive reader closure and names its changed cause;
- equal reproduction retains allocation and generation and wakes nobody;
- recursive publications without external ground retract; independently grounded siblings survive;
- same-version artifacts are byte-identical; diagnostics retain exact current provenance; runtime/ABI/semantic answers retain fidelity;
- no unexplained or readiness-only work starts remain.

## Required deletion audit

Repository and production-path inspection must find no InputFlow authority, semantic-body copy, key-derived evidence reconstruction, private semantic cone/fixpoint, global normal-drive discovery scan, duplicate source owner, parallel product value store, dormant experiment, obsolete telemetry, compatibility path, or stale documentation. Temporary fixtures and probes leave unless they are durable production-boundary regressions.

## Gates

Run focused causal lenses, serial library and fixture matrix, all target doors, cross-process determinism, docs, formatting, cargo check, and strict Clippy. Wall-clock and CI duration corroborate deterministic counts but never replace them. Fresh ticket-scoped cold adversarial review before the ticket's one commit and close.
